      "summary_en": "Teemo scampers around, passively increasing his Move Speed until he is struck by an enemy champion or turret. Teemo can sprint to gain bonus Move Speed that isn't stopped by being struck for a short time.",
      "summary_zh": "提莫动如脱兔，提升移动速度，直到被敌方英雄或防御塔击中为止。提莫可以通过冲刺来获得额外移动速度，且短时间内不会因被击中而使加速效果中止。",
